    "detailed_description": "<h1>Also recommended for you:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1750897580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1750897580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1750897580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A Broken Halo</strong> is a top down turn-based puzzle game about an angel which had its halo broken into pieces while on a mission, and needs to retrieve the remaining pieces to get its powers back.<br><br><strong>Feature Set</strong><br><br><strong>- Turn-based movement</strong><br>Engage in turn-based puzzles to clear the rooms and complete your mission!<br><br><strong>- Scenery will react to the player\u2019s actions</strong><br>Be aware of your choices! Moving will affect the entire board configuration!<br><br><strong>- Different behavior for different enemies.</strong><br>Pay attention to your enemy patterns, they are the key to keep advancing!<br> <br><strong>- Unleash your final power</strong><br>Find the pieces of your broken halo to recover your full strength!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1750897580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1750897580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1750897580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A Broken Halo</strong> is a top down turn-based puzzle game about an angel which had its halo broken into pieces while on a mission, and needs to retrieve the remaining pieces to get its powers back.<br><br><strong>Feature Set</strong><br><br><strong>- Turn-based movement</strong><br>Engage in turn-based puzzles to clear the rooms and complete your mission!<br><br><strong>- Scenery will react to the player\u2019s actions</strong><br>Be aware of your choices! Moving will affect the entire board configuration!<br><br><strong>- Different behavior for different enemies.</strong><br>Pay attention to your enemy patterns, they are the key to keep advancing!<br> <br><strong>- Unleash your final power</strong><br>Find the pieces of your broken halo to recover your full strength!",
    "short_description": "A Broken Halo is a 2D Puzzle game. You play as Zime, an angel that had her Halo destroyed by an evil mage. Now, she has to recover the broken pieces of her Halo and destroy her nemesis. Is Zime going to survive this challenge?",
